---
import Bubbles from './Bubbles.astro';
const stack = ['Next.js', 'TypeScript', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Sanity', 'Vercel'];
---

<section id="top" class="relative overflow-hidden px-6 pb-28 pt-20 sm:pt-28">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 opacity-40">
    <div class="absolute -left-24 top-10 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-pool-500 blur-[120px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute right-0 top-40 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-splash-500 blur-[140px]"></div>
  </div>
  <Bubbles count={18} />
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 -z-10 h-24" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="ripple-ring absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 h-24 w-24 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full" />
    <span
      class="ripple-ring absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 h-24 w-24 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full"
      style="animation-delay:1.4s"
    />
    <span
      class="ripple-ring absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 h-24 w-24 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full"
      style="animation-delay:2.8s"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
    <p class="section-kicker">Læringsopplegg · Fontenehuset Bergen × Varegg Media</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-white sm:text-6xl">
      Klar for stup? Bygg den nye<br />
      <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-splash-400 to-pool-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
        Bergen Stupeklubb
      </span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-pool-200">
      Dagens side er en oppussingsklar Squarespace-side med ødelagte lenker, tunge bilder og en meny
      som ikke vet hvem den snakker til. Dere skal bygge den på nytt — fra bunnen, med ordentlig kode,
      og et ekte resultat dere kan vise fram etterpå. Vi gir hint, tips og lenker til dokumentasjon
      hele veien — dere skal bare tørre å hoppe.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
      {stack.map((tech) => (
        <span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-pool-100">
          {tech}
        </span>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="#modulene"
        class="btn-splash rounded-full bg-splash-500 px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-xl shadow-splash-500/30 transition hover:scale-[1.03] hover:bg-splash-400"
      >
        Se de 7 modulene
      </a>
      <a
        href="#problemene"
        class="btn-splash rounded-full border border-white/20 px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-white/10"
      >
        Hva er galt i dag?
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-8 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-pool-400">↓ 0 meter — overflaten</p>
  </div>
</section>
